  "method": "Run the same split preview against a local HTTP range server with the original PDF.js worker and the modified worker. In Chromium, a probe in the range-stream constructor exposes its byte storage through a WeakRef. Read the contiguous buffer byte length or sum the stored chunk byte lengths after the first and last pages have selectable text, and after searching all pages. Compare RGBA and selectable-text SHA-256 on both pages and the full ordered search state against the original worker in each browser. Repeat the content checks with the emitted split and all-in-one builds over HTTP ranges and local File slices. Use a 1000 × 800 viewport at device pixel ratio 1.",
